WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.280
move the left gripper toward the next bottle.

2
00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.160
grasp the bottle with the left gripper.

3
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.720
raise the bottle clear of the table.

4
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.880
move the bottle above the dustbin.

5
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.080
release the bottle into the dustbin.

6
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.240
move the left gripper toward the next bottle.

7
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.280
grasp the bottle with the left gripper.

8
00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:14.940
raise the bottle clear of the table.

9
00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.380
move the bottle above the dustbin.

10
00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:17.580
release the bottle into the dustbin.

11
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.080
withdraw the left hand to make room for the next bottle.

12
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:30.660
keep the left hand steady and wait for the other hand to complete the bottle handover.

13
00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.220
move the left gripper toward the next bottle.

14
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.840
grasp the exposed part of the bottle held by the other hand.

15
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.340
keep the left hand steady and wait for the other hand to complete the bottle handover.

16
00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.959
move the bottle above the dustbin.

